body:json {
  {
    "description": "Updated proposal text with additional context. I have 3+ years of experience in this domain and have delivered similar projects on time."
  }
}

docs {
  ## Update Applied Job — Description Only

  Updates the description of a proposal with status DRAFT or PENDING.
  Replace `PROPOSAL_UUID` with a real proposal ID.

  ### Allowed Fields
  - `description` (optional)
  - `attachments` (optional)
  - `status`: only "DRAFT" or "PENDING" (optional)

  ### Business Rules
  - Must be the applicant (or ADMIN).
  - Proposal status must be DRAFT or PENDING; otherwise 400.

  ### Success Response (200)
  ```json
  {
    "success": true,
    "message": "Proposal updated successfully",
    "data": { ... updated proposal }
  }
  ```
}
